{
  "dialogueEntries": [
    {
      "name": "MainCharacter",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "It's been a long time since we've been back to Maplemire."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "We should try to load up on supplies, while we can."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "It's not much further til we get to the castle."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Astrid",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "That sounds like a good idea."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Doesn't town seem awfully quiet, though? Where is everybody?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "MainCharacter",
      "pauseExecution": "true",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "You're right, something's off--"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Wait a second."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Something is going on at the church over there."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lucas",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Back off, chump!"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "We don't have any of those stinkin' relics!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Celeste",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Oh dear.. Please forgive my brother, sir. But he speaks true."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Our goddess, Ilvera, forbids us to lie. We do not possess any relics."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Soldier",
      "pauseExecution": "true",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "I understand that priestess, but I have orders."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "If you don't comply, my superiors--"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lance",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Well well well! Wha' do we got 'er?"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "A couple of sky worshippers. What's wrong? Your \"goddess\" didn't tell you we were coming?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Celeste",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "The goddess guides us all."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "May she lead you to her warmth and understanding..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lance",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Pft. I don't need any phony goddess."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "The only thing I need is all of the church tithings!"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Now hand them over!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lucas",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "We already told you and your crooks, we don't have any relics!"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "So get lost, jerk!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lance",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Woo weeee! The mouth on this one! Tsk tsk, your god should've taught you better manners!"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Let's go boys! Turn this town upside down!"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "By order of Lord Beesly, find every relic you can!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lucas",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Come on, sis! We gotta make a break for it!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Celeste",
      "pauseExecution": "true",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Goddess, protect us..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "MainCharacter",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Wait what-- Lord Beesly's orders?"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "That can't be.."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Astrid",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Look over there!"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Those people running away from the church, they look like they are in danger!"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "We can worry about Lord Beesly later, right now they need our help!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "MainCharacter",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "You're right. Let's go!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "MainCharacter",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Looks like we managed to scare them off for now."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Is everybody alright?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Celeste",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Yes... thank you for saving us..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lucas",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "I could've taken them, but thanks for the backup."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Astrid",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "First home, and now this... what in the world is going on?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "MainCharacter",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Lord Beesly would've never allowed this."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "This must be a rogue group of soldiers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Celeste",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "I'm afraid you're mistaken... Lord Beesly has not been himself of late..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lucas",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Yeah, where have you been?? Living out in the woods or somethin'?"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Lord Beesly has been anything but kind."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "He's been sending out his cronies to do random searches all over town."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "This is just another one of his shakedowns."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Celeste",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "But to attack the church..."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "I fear this may only be the beginning..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Astrid",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Come with us!"
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "It's not safe here anymore."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "MainCharacter",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "She's right."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "We're headed to the castle now to get to the bottom of this."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "We'll have more power in numbers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Celeste",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Thank you..."
        },
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "May Ilvera bless you..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lucas",
      "lines": [
        {
          "emotion": "idle",
          "line": "Hmph.."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}